.TH ENGINE_QUIT 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
engine_quit \- End the main loop after the current frame
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqengine.h\(dq
.BI "void engine_quit(Engine *e);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
End the main loop after the current frame. Usable from any scene or menu action. Scenes still on the stack get their on_exit from engine_shutdown().
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH MODULE
core (src/engine/core/engine.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR engine_run (3),
.BR engine_shutdown (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
